1
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,760
I wish you could all be inside my head.

2
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,990
The conversation is sparkling.

3
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:23,030
Fine, I'll tell you.

4
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:26,240
A lichen is an organism made up of two separate species,

5
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,720
fungi and algae.

6
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,660
If you could merge with another species,

7
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:32,390
what species would you pick and why?

8
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:35,120
Hint: There is a right answer.

9
00:00:36,430 --> 00:00:37,990
None of you will get it.

10
00:00:39,190 --> 00:00:41,850
Okay, I'd pick swan because,

11
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:43,480
uh, the resulting hybrid would have

12
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:46,200
the advanced industrial civilization of a human

13
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:49,540
and the long graceful neck I've always dreamed of having.

14
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:53,130
Wrong. Leonard?

15
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:56,800
Horse, but mostly just for the height.

16
00:00:57,750 --> 00:00:59,770
A little bit for the genital girth.

17
00:01:01,810 --> 00:01:04,260
Wrong, and let's keep it clean, shall we?

18
00:01:05,420 --> 00:01:06,600
Kangaroo, uh,

19
00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:08,600
I'd be Kanga-Jew.

20
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:12,930
The first of my people to dunk a basketball.

21
00:01:13,570 --> 00:01:15,400
Also instead of just living in your mother's house,

22
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:17,600
you could actually live inside her body.

23
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:23,690
Clever, but also wrong.

24
00:01:23,690 --> 00:01:26,550
No, the best organism for human beings to merge with

25
00:01:26,550 --> 00:01:27,990
is the lichen itself.

26
00:01:27,990 --> 00:01:31,150
That way, you'd be human, fungus, and algae.

27
00:01:31,150 --> 00:01:32,370
Triple threat.

28
00:01:33,020 --> 00:01:34,590
Like three-bean salad.

29
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:38,260
Give me one circumstance in which that would be useful.

30
00:01:38,260 --> 00:01:39,260
All right, picture this:

31
00:01:39,260 --> 00:01:41,730
