Anyway, it's a beautiful time of year.

63
00:02:58,310 --> 00:03:00,310
Uh, you travel through the vineyards.

64
00:03:00,310 --> 00:03:01,540
There's a tasting on board.

65
00:03:01,540 --> 00:03:04,080
And all the wildflowers are in bloom.

66
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:06,020
Magic.

67
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:08,260
Look at that, in 30 seconds,

68
00:03:08,260 --> 00:03:10,930
