121
00:05:48,610 --> 00:05:50,280
Oh, yeah, no worries.

122
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:52,120
And maybe a few bucks for the valet.

123
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,140
Oh, all right.

124
00:05:53,140 --> 00:05:55,080
And gas money to get home.

125
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:57,330
- Yeah, sure. - Great.

126
