149
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:03,710
This is a map of Pasadena.

150
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:05,620
This is a list of local restaurants.

151
00:07:05,620 --> 00:07:07,020
And then, for Howie's relatives,

152
00:07:07,020 --> 00:07:08,820
