210
00:09:31,780 --> 00:09:33,190
Hacha!

211
00:09:35,070 --> 00:09:36,650
Okay... Let me see here.

212
00:09:36,650 --> 00:09:38,530
Okay, kidding aside--

213
00:09:38,530 --> 00:09:40,810
Howard, you are a good friend.

214
00:09:40,810 --> 00:09:42,970
And I wish you nothing but happiness.

215
00:09:42,970 --> 00:09:44,580
Bazinga, I don't!

216
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:48,050
- Sheldon... - Double bazinga! I do!

217
00:09:49,660 --> 00:09:51,580
Good luck following that.

218
00:09:54,250 --> 00:09:57,060
