227
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:24,790
Then...

228
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:25,660
Nobody cares, Hofstadter.

229
00:10:25,660 --> 00:10:26,860
Wrap it up.

230
00:10:27,420 --> 00:10:28,440
Right.

231
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,490
To Howard.

232
00:10:29,490 --> 00:10:31,180
To Howard.

233
00:10:31,180 --> 00:10:33,090
I totally had sex in the ocean.

234
00:10:35,060 --> 00:10:38,310
Okay, I'll go.

