237
00:10:48,300 --> 00:10:50,420
I can't help but get a little choked up.

238
00:10:50,420 --> 00:10:51,080
I mean...

239
00:10:51,730 --> 00:10:52,220
look at you.

240
00:10:52,220 --> 00:10:54,680
You have everything.

241
00:10:55,900 --> 00:10:56,620
Look at me.

242
00:10:56,620 --> 00:10:58,640
I'm 37.

243
00:10:58,640 --> 00:11:01,160
I sleep in the back of a comic book store,

244
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:04,620
