245
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:09,170
To Howard.

246
00:11:10,770 --> 00:11:12,730
To Howard.

247
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:15,830
- Um, uh, who's next?  - I'll go.

248
00:11:16,750 --> 00:11:20,390
Howard, I'm gonna say something to you that everybody's thinking

249
00:11:20,390 --> 00:11:22,950
