- Hear, hear.  - Hear, hear.

256
00:11:37,830 --> 00:11:39,580
Okay, uh, anybody else?

257
00:11:39,580 --> 00:11:41,430
Huh? No?

258
00:11:41,430 --> 00:11:46,680
Okay, it all comes down to me, the best man.

259
00:11:47,940 --> 00:11:51,170
Ooh! This grasshopper is kicking my ass-hopper.

260
